! Bhupali.ascl
!
Bhupali in F - Nadi (just intonation). Serene major pentatonic: Sa Re Ga Pa Dha. No Ma, no Ni.
!
 5
!
 9/8
 5/4
 3/2
 5/3
 2/1
!
! Scale degrees (the annotations that used to sit on the pitch lines):
!   Re    203.91 cents
!   Ga    386.31 cents
!   Pa    701.96 cents
!   Dha   884.36 cents
!   Sa'  1200.00 cents
!
! Matches Nadi's internal tuning exactly, so instruments in this tuning
! and Nadi's resonators lock together instead of beating.
